I'd start with something like

x <- seq(from=-3, to=6.5, by=0.1)

for (i in 1:length(x)) {
  if(x[i] <= 2) {
    y[i] <- x[i]^2
    } else if(x[i] > 2) {
      y[i] <- 6-x[i]
      }
  }

plot(x, y)

There are plenty of possibilities to tune plot look and feel.

